## 🎯 About the Repository

Finding relevant engineering internships can be challenging. This repository organizes internship resources and application guidance to make the search easier for aspiring mechanical engineers.

The focus areas include:

- ⚙️ Mechanical Design and Product Development
- 🌡️ Thermal Engineering, HVAC, and Energy Systems
- 🏭 Manufacturing and Production Engineering
- 🤖 Robotics and Industrial Automation
- 📐 Finite Element Analysis (FEA) and Computational Fluid Dynamics (CFD)
- 🔬 Research and Development
- 📡 Industrial IoT and Smart Manufacturing

**Goal:** Help students connect academic knowledge with practical engineering experience.

